# Large CouchDB dump that feeds the container clustering pipeline.
# Regenerate with: php get_view.php > container.tsv
# That only works while the works database is populated -- container.tsv is
# derived from container-title/ISSN across every work record. If you are about
# to wipe the database, archive this file first; the clustering *output* is kept
# in clustering/container_docs.json.gz, which is committed.
/container.tsv
